<title>GERMANY: Sero 1995/96 ord earnings rise 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Sero 1995/96 ord earnings rise 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			     7.6    vs   6.5</p>
<p>    Group earnings on ord business around 13.7    vs  10.1</p>
<p>    Group DVFA/SG profit			10.7    vs 10.2</p>
<p>    Group DVFA earnings per share	   1.48    vs 1.42 DMK</p>
<p>    Group sales			  around 170     vs  135</p>
<p>    Group output			 around 180     vs  135</p>
<p>    Dividend					0.60    vs  0.30 DMK</p>
<p>    Total dividend payout		     4.32    vs  1.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German waste management group is Sero Entsorgungs AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
